ral":0,"high":0},"basis":"Separate dated support priors preserve conserved cohort debits despite underdetermined source generations. Each shared pool receives its preceding modeled movement once. Initial support is the smallest rounded central envelope funding all three supplied scenarios at zero growth (low support40%, high220% of central), plus separately stated retained-core allowance. These are visualization bookkeeping priors, not source population claims. Unknown source baselines remain unknown. Default display unit: 1 dot = 1,000 people. The report’s original 2,500-person dot unit and dot counts remain in evidence. Low/central/high values are supplied visualization scenarios, not censuses or statistical confidence intervals.","displayPrior":{"low":0,"central":0,"high":0,"requiredByTier":{"low":0,"central":0,"high":0},"retainedCentral":0,"sourceBaseline":null,"method":"Maximum cumulative debit deficit across scenarios; rounded up to1,000 central people with declared retained-core allowance","basis":"Separate dated support priors preserve conserved cohort debits despite underdetermined source generations. Each shared pool receives its preceding modeled movement once. Initial support is the smallest rounded central envelope funding all three supplied scenarios at zero growth (low support40%, high220% of central), plus separately stated retained-core allowance. These are visualization bookkeeping priors, not source population claims. Unknown source baselines remain unknown. Default display unit: 1 dot = 1,000 people. The report’s original 2,500-person dot unit and dot counts remain in evidence. Low/central/high values are supplied visualization scenarios, not censuses or statistical confidence intervals."}},{"id":"YENISEI-KYRGYZ","name":"Yenisei Kyrgyz standing core","coord":[91.4,53.7],"start":-209,"points":[[91.9559506324459,54.31611083589616],[94.28699239094027,51.74658998343456],[91.31033182149837,53.78362150474515],[90.79383677274035,53.48779409855014],[91.5